{"version":1,"content":"<p>泰國內閣周二批准將完全進口「電池電動車」（BEV）的企業工商稅（excise tax）由10%大幅提升35%，完全進口「增程型（range-extended）電動車」（REEV）的工商稅也由15%升至35%，明年1月生效。</p><p>副首相兼財政大臣Ekniti Nitithanprapas解釋，此舉旨在鼓勵投資和本地生產。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.615833+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T17:58:30.405504+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.350378+00:00","content_hash":"34d8af1d12bbf3399e9d11ab9079b92024e6ba43f9d7ac443e81a6b94e7b5f18","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}